# PlatformIO tests

This folder contains hardware-independent tests for the tracking helpers.

Run the tests from the repository root:

```sh
pio test -e native
```

The current suite checks angular wrapping, finite-value handling, observer-coordinate and altitude limits, NORAD ID ranges, and the accepted Astronomy Engine body IDs.

The native tests do not exercise FreeRTOS scheduling, I2C peripherals, motor drivers, the Astronomy Engine library integration, or real SGP4/TLE data. Those still require an ESP32 build and hardware/bench testing.
